# Twists and Turns replaces the explore with a scry and the explore (CR 614.6), so it still happens - and "whenever a creature you control explores" is about that
# explore (CR 701.44a-b, 603.2). Bot1's Merfolk Cave-Diver is the target of Twists and Turns' enters trigger: Bot1 scries the Lightning Bolt and keeps it on top, the Diver
# explores it (a +1/+1 counter, and Bot1 leaves the Bolt on top), and the Diver gets +1/+0 and can't be blocked: with the counter, a 4/5.

